{
	"info": {
		"name": "WomansDay API",
		"description": "Corporate March 8th event API.\n\n## Auth\nRegister or Login to get tokens. Tokens are auto-saved to collection variables.\n\n## Response Models\n\n### AuthResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"login\": \"masha\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"department\": \"Accounting\",\n  \"role\": \"user\",\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhb...\",\n  \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhb...\",\n  \"expiresIn\": 3600\n}\n```\n\n### MeResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"balance\": 1500,\n  \"hasAvatar\": true\n}\n```\n\n### UserResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"login\": \"masha\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"department\": \"Accounting\",\n  \"hasAvatar\": true,\n  \"earned\": 1500\n}\n```\n\n### TaskResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"Selfie\",\n  \"description\": \"...\",\n  \"reward\": 500,\n  \"type\": \"photo\",\n  \"collaborative\": true,\n  \"myStatus\": \"pending\",\n  \"mySubmission\": { ...SubmissionResponse }\n}\n```\n\n### SubmissionResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"submitterId\": 2,\n  \"submitterLogin\": \"masha\",\n  \"submitterFirstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"submitterLastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"submitterDepartment\": \"Accounting\",\n  \"participants\": [UserResponse],\n  \"pendingParticipants\": [UserResponse],\n  \"status\": \"pending\",\n  \"text\": \"...\",\n  \"createdAtEpoch\": 1741428600000,\n  \"photoIds\": [1, 2]\n}\n```\n\n### BudgetResponse\n```json\n{\n  \"totalBudget\": 12500,\n  \"approvedBudget\": 3200\n}\n```\n\n### Error Response\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\",\n  \"message\": \"Login is already taken\"\n}\n```\n\n## Statuses\n- `notStarted` — user has not submitted\n- `waitingForParticipants` — waiting for invited participants\n- `invited` — user has a pending invitation\n- `pending` — awaiting admin review\n- `approved` — approved by admin\n- `rejected` — rejected by admin\n- `cancelled` — all participants declined",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
		{ "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" }
	],
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"masha\",\n  \"password\": \"securepass1\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Maria\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Ivanova\",\n  \"department\": \"Accounting\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
						},
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"description": "Register a new user. Returns tokens (auto-saved)."
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var data = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"adminpassword\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
						},
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"description": "Login with credentials. Returns tokens (auto-saved)."
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var data = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Refresh Token",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"]
						},
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"description": "Get new access + refresh tokens using the current refresh token."
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var data = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Change Password",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"securepass1\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"newsecurepass1\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "change-password"]
						},
						"description": "Change password for the authenticated user."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Logout",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
						},
						"description": "Invalidate the refresh token."
					}
				}
			]
		},
